      "blurb": "Water Release: Supreme Water Lion",
      "summonRole": "Supreme Water Lion",
      "biography": "<p><em>Water Release: Supreme Water Lion (S-Rank, concentration up to 1 minute).</em> It uses your Ninjutsu attack bonus and save DC; you command it as a Bonus Action, and can merge into its head (total cover) while touching it.</p><p><strong>Huge Construct.</strong> <strong>Armor Class</strong> 23 · <strong>Hit Points</strong> 105 · <strong>Speed</strong> 40 ft.</p><p><strong>Abilities</strong> STR +6 (save +9), DEX +3 (save +5), CON +9 (save +5), INT −5 (save −5), WIS +0 (save +0), CHA +5 (save −5). <strong>Damage Resistances</strong> Fire. <strong>Damage Vulnerabilities</strong> Earth. <strong>Condition Immunities</strong> All Mental, Sensory and Elemental, Incapacitated. <strong>Senses</strong> Darkvision 60 ft., passive Perception 10.</p><p><strong>Linked to you when summoned:</strong> your Ninjutsu attack bonus and save DC.</p>"
